"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-31T16:24:23Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:20Z","closed_at":"2025-07-31T17:33:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109168","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109168.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109168.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12850\r\n\r\nThis method allows the game developers to easily and conveniently comply with open source licenses of Godot Engine and the thirdparty libraries Godot uses. Also added a warning message that every Godot game has to comply with the open source licenses, it can be opened by opening the Export dialog, and after opening once it won't open again, here's what the warning looks like:\r\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"249\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4953d9ee-3513-4941-9d9f-ffeff50f7b14\" />\r\nAfter pressing OK it takes the user to the `Engine.get_copyright_text()` documentation.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure this is the right way to add new popup windows, but it does its job :D\r\n\r\n~~But there's a known bug that I'm not sure how to fix: this method doesn't work well with unicode characters:\r\n<img width=\"530\" height=\"90\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c2fa36d-d17d-4e9b-93e9-fa1d12a6d2cb\" />\r\nEven though the text looks correct in Visual Studio and VS Code:\r\n<img width=\"649\" height=\"175\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/409ef603-3805-484e-b017-0667c67edd70\" />~~\r\nEDIT: the bug was fixed!","closed_by":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109168/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}